 <div class="table-responsive"><table class="table align-middle responsive-stack-table system-data-table"><thead><tr><th>الوصف</th><th>الكمية</th><th>سعر الوحدة ₪</th><th>خصم البند ₪</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody data-invoice-lines><tr data-invoice-line><td data-label="الوصف"><input class="form-control" aria-label="وصف البند" name="items[0][description]" value="علاج جذور — الجلسة الأولى" required form="invoice-draft-form"></td><td data-label="الكمية"><input class="form-control" aria-label="الكمية" data-line-quantity name="items[0][quantity]" type="number" min="1" step="1" value="1" required form="invoice-draft-form"></td><td data-label="سعر الوحدة ₪"><input class="form-control" aria-label="سعر الوحدة" data-line-price name="items[0][unit_price]" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="500" required form="invoice-draft-form"></td><td data-label="خصم البند ₪"><input class="form-control" aria-label="خصم البند" data-line-discount name="items[0][discount]" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="0" required form="invoice-draft-form"></td><td data-label="الإجراء"><button class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm" type="button" data-remove-invoice-line>حذف</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
 <button class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm mb-3" data-add-invoice-line type="button">إضافة بند إداري</button><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="initial_payment">المدفوع عند الإصدار ₪</label><input class="form-control" id="initial_payment" name="initial_payment" type="number" value="0" form="invoice-draft-form" min="0" step="0.01" data-initial-payment></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label" for="initial_payment_method">طريقة الدفع</label><select class="form-select" id="initial_payment_method" name="initial_payment_method" form="invoice-draft-form"><option value="cash">نقدًا</option><option value="card">بطاقة</option><option value="bank_transfer">تحويل</option></select></div></div>
 <div class="alert alert-light border mt-3" aria-live="polite">الإجمالي: <strong data-invoice-total>500.00</strong> ₪ — المتبقي: <strong data-invoice-remaining>500.00</strong> ₪</div><p class="small text-secondary">بعد الإصدار تثبت البنود؛ الدفعة تسجّل مستقلة. الإلغاء مسموح فقط إن لم تُسجّل أي دفعة.</p><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-primary" form="invoice-draft-form" name="action" value="save_draft">حفظ المسودة</button><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" form="invoice-draft-form" name="action" value="issue" data-requires-permission="invoices.issue">إصدار الفاتورة</button></div></section></div>
